.env.*
!.env.example
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
secrets/
**/secrets/
service-account*.json
*-firebase-adminsdk-*.json
**/config.h
!**/config.example.h

# Firma Android de producción
android/key.properties
**/*.jks
**/*.keystore

